{
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.01.01": "我原先也这么想，直到那位来转了两趟。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.02.01": "那事跟我半点不沾边，这点我可以对着牧师起誓。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.03.01": "我打赌，再穿%122$s天的黑衣，就该照常办事了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.04.01": "%50$s，竟连个清静的退场都办不到。这可有说头。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.04.02": "我什么都没听见，什么都没看见。聪明人都是这么做的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.05.01": "那一家子有%20$s张嘴都跟你要东西，换了你，难道不躲？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.05.02": "%37$s何曾理会我们这种人。从来没有。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.06.01": "那得看你先听到的是哪一套瞎话。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.06.02": "一半是真的，另一半更糟，这村子你又不是不知道。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.07.01": "新的令状就意味着又有新法子，为你喘气不顺就罚你的钱。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.07.02": "依我看，自%145$s坐上那个位子起，%64$s就没干过一天正经活。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.08.01": "领主越多，嘴越多，留给我们的面包越少。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.08.02": "有%121$s名骑士去护卫他们，却没有一个来护卫我们。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.09.01": "味道跟一向一样。你就是心情不好罢了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.09.02": "也许是让霜打过了。要不就是你终于尝出它一向有多难喝。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.10.01": "修过两回了。第三回也许终于能斗得过那只山羊。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.10.02": "等那只羊不需要修的时候，我就去修。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.10.03": "篱笆好好的。该换的是那只羊。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.10.04": "在弄了。慢慢来。非常慢。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.11.01": "累就是我如今的模样。从前也俊俏过，据他们这么讲。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.11.02": "今天我这光景，累算是最不打紧的。别让我开这个头。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.11.03": "等孩子们睡了我再睡。那就是没得睡。不过我还是抱着指望。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.12.01": "多半就是这样。我可瞧见过它们看你的眼神。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.12.02": "听着倒像那么回事。一群没良心的东西，这些鸡。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.12.03": "下一步你就要梦见山羊也有主见了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.12.04": "早跟你说过，睡前别吃奶酪。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.13.01": "那笔买卖亏了，你自己也清楚。不过芜菁耐放。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.13.02": "那得看你有多爱吃芜菁了，我猜。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.14.01": "面包师什么话都敢打包票。多半是为了多卖些面包。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.14.02": "我这腰疼了好些年了。看来我有了多吃面包的好借口。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.14.03": "下一步他就该卖连赋税都能治好的面包了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.15.01": "你什么都要拿绿宝石打赌，你手头一颗不剩，一半就坏在这上头。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.15.02": "成交。等我赢了，药水归你买。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.16.01": "老妇人的无稽之谈。不过那口井确实干过两回了……",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.16.02": "别说出口。有些事还是不要去招惹为好。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.17.01": "猫不跟人走。它们跟着身上有鱼味的人走。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.17.02": "也许它喜欢你。也许它正打量你。猫这种家伙，难说。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.17.03": "喂它一次，它这辈子就是你的了，这是规矩。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.18.01": "这是这个月第三只了。胆子真大。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.18.02": "也许你该学学怎么把鸡舍关严实。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.18.03": "照这势头下去，狐狸吃得比这条街上一半人还好。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.18.04": "要么下套子，要么剩下的也保不住。更好的法子是修好鸡舍，一只不落。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.19.01": "我也没有。有什么东西让狗叫了一整夜。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.19.02": "试试热牛奶。要不就来口烈酒。两样总有一个管用。总能睡着的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.19.03": "欢迎入伙。我们这儿没一个睡得安稳的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.20.01": "找王室讨价还价，兴许还容易些。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.20.02": "早该带你妻子来的。她准能说得他掉眼泪。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.21.01": "是中了诅咒，还是天生就讨人嫌？鸡的事可说不准。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.21.02": "凌晨四点，哪只鸡都像中了诅咒。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.21.03": "你也骂回去就是了。总不会更糟。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.22.01": "多半是酵母坏了。不是每次失败都得扯上什么征兆。有时候面包就只是面包。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.22.02": "这话别说得太大声，这附近有些人会当真。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.22.03": "发不起来的面包也算凶兆，那这条街早就没救了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.23.01": "不知什么事逼得他连轴转。真想知道是什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.23.02": "我的耳朵到现在还没饶过他。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.24.01": "又或者他压根不会钓鱼，只是不肯认。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.24.02": "等着瞧吧。他宁可怪天气，也不会怪自己。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.25.01": "那喊声我亲耳听见了。可没敢往窗外看。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.25.02": "总有事，是不是。就没个安生的一周。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.25.03": "去问铁匠吧。一有乱子，他多半是头一个知道的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.26.01": "什么都比上个月翻了一倍，不光肉价。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.26.02": "这价钱我宁可饿着也不掏。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.26.03": "等农夫下回收成上来。收完之后价钱准跌。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.27.01": "那你买了吗？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.27.02": "破碗配破主意，倒也前后一致。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.28.01": "他也没忘，信我。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.28.02": "那么旧的靴子，光穿着走，你就已经受够了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.29.01": "木棍当剑，锅盖当盾。我们当年也这样。他们日后想起来会觉得暖心。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.29.02": "是吵，总好过他们在屋里缠在我脚边。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.29.03": "趁年纪小就让他们玩吧。真刀真剑的日子来得快得很。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.30.01": "让制箭师教他们吧。趁着他们正起劲，学得正经些更好。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.30.02": "不出一个星期就没兴致了，跟上一桩一样。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.30.03": "学弓总比没人看着往铁匠铺乱跑强。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.31.01": "我心里有数是谁，赌你也一样。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.31.02": "要么把篱笆修结实些，要么直接去跟他们把话说开。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.32.01": "用不着猜，我在这儿都闻见了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.32.02": "主意倒是大胆，办得却一塌糊涂。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.32.03": "这里头总藏着点教训。只怕你学不会。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.33.01": "好消息走得慢。坏消息早饭前就到了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.33.02": "不管是什么事，晚饭前就能听出三个版本。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.34.01": "想必是大事。要不就是大伙儿争得太久。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.34.02": "宫廷的事。十个人说话，一个人拿主意。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.35.01": "是说村里的事，还是说我们俩的事？这可不一样。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.35.02": "那就最好开始显得有点用处。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.36.01": "等一个星期。总有个大人物会把它搅黄。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.36.02": "好。我宁可跟他们做买卖，也不愿为这些事埋人。道理占了上风，总是好事。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.37.01": "有意思。上一季大家还口口声声说信不过他们。人是会改主意的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.37.02": "这就是外交。今天被骂作野种的，明天就是席上宾。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.38.01": "一见穿得体面的生人，总有人这么说。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.38.02": "真要是够分量的人物，传令官自会闹得我们谁也别想漏掉。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.39.01": "该收他们一笔洗衣钱的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.39.02": "至少你能说，疆域的守卫们走得像有正事。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.40.01": "哪天再问我吧。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.40.02": "这种问题，最好别让宫廷听见你在问。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.40.03": "那要看这期间是谁在教%105$s。还有时间学。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.41.01": "你的衣裳？说不定人家还帮了你一把。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.41.02": "先把树篱翻一遍，再开口怪整个村子。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.41.03": "风也是会偷东西的，你知道。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.42.01": "你这才想起告诉大家？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.42.02": "那是我的。几年前丢了三颗绿宝石。不多不少三颗。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.42.03": "放回去。藏起来的钱财，主家总不是什么善类。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.43.01": "是鸟。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.44.01": "很精的鸟。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.45.01": "狗跑得快。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.45.02": "手慢了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.45.03": "我看赢得挺公道。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.46.01": "那兴许是门本身就跟你过不去。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.47.01": "但愿没人找得出用得着它的理由。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.48.01": "我怕的就是你说这种话。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.49.01": "年景好也喝，年景坏也喝。那准是更糟的事。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.49.02": "兴许他们终于开始攒绿宝石了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.50.01": "那墙早就知道我说得对了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.51.01": "当心。早饭桌上讲这话，快赶上谋反了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.51.02": "面包便宜点我就知足了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.51.03": "把这写进请愿书，我就签名。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.52.01": "多半在琢磨这笔钱谁来出。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.52.02": "统治者操心的事跟咱们不一样。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.52.03": "你可以去问。你问的时候我可不站你旁边。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.53.01": "石头有见识，不掺和这些事。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.53.02": "它们多半还能熬过接下来的那几位。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.53.03": "真让人想知道，它们要是会说话，会说些什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.54.01": "多半的馊主意，当初怕也是一样。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.54.02": "给谁一个头衔，转眼大家就都忘了他是从哪儿来的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.54.03": "说不定我们身边站着的就是下一位。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.55.01": "如今同一条街上的人，我都没几个认得了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.55.02": "村子变成首都，就是这么回事。说明我们做对了些什么。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.55.03": "比起那些面孔，我更想念从前的清静。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.56.01": "总该有人劝他们慢着点。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.56.02": "房子比人好养活。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.56.03": "至少孩子总有不再需要新屋顶的一天。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.57.01": "赶路的？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.57.02": "也许是又一家人想留下来。但愿他们喜欢这里。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.57.03": "过不了一星期，他们也就把各家的事摸清了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.58.01": "地方一兴旺，名声就传开了。听上去传出去的都是好缘由。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.58.02": "车多了，泥也多了。据说这就叫兴旺。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.58.03": "对买卖好。对睡觉不好。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.59.01": "所以才总那么挤。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.59.02": "只要人人嗓门够大，一处好嚼舌根的地儿就够了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.59.03": "我们缺的是另一口井，不是另一处嚼舌根的地儿。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.60.01": "总算有个明白主意。地方要长大，就该再添一口井。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.60.02": "再打一口井，不过是再多一处供大伙儿站着闲扯的地方。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.60.03": "先找个人把第一口井修好，再谈更大的想头吧。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.61.01": "可不知怎的，大家还都嫌不够。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.61.02": "闲话是咱们唯一不缺的东西。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.61.03": "可惜闲话烤不成面包。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.62.01": "说不定碍着别人路的正是你自己。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.62.02": "首都的日子就是这样。人多了，地方小了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.62.03": "不妨数数他们里头你真心喜欢的能有几个。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.63.01": "等下了雨，你又该嫌泥多了。至少尘土是没了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.63.02": "我早就不擦靴子了。省得白盼一场。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.64.01": "还能在哪儿？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.64.02": "在这镇上？我可不敢想当然。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.64.03": "要是有人把你的床偷走了，这份气力我倒有几分佩服。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.65.01": "我猜卫兵又是从谁家表亲那儿听来的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.65.02": "那就是说，没一个真见过的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.65.03": "按村里的规矩，这差不多就算官面上的话了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.66.01": "又来了？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.66.02": "那就别再拿「我听说」起头了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.66.03": "你这辈子就没拒绝过一次闲话。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.67.01": "明白。一查证，好故事就毁了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.67.02": "那你怎么知道那事古怪？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.68.01": "那你干嘛告诉我？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.68.02": "当然不会。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.68.03": "我可不敢保证。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.69.01": "那我就当它比听着还糟。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.69.02": "行吧。那我自己编个说法。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.69.03": "你越这样，我越要问。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.70.01": "鸡也就知道谷子在哪儿。别的没什么了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.70.02": "那一只盯着人看的样子，我是见过的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.70.03": "你跟鸡待在一起的时候太长了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.71.01": "迷信的人总这么说。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.71.02": "到底是对什么有经验？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.71.03": "行。要长见识，离我远点去长。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.72.01": "比我叫得出名的某些人有条理多了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.72.02": "有一只瞪着我，像是我欠了税。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.72.03": "再给它们一星期，就该开始颁敕令了。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.73.01": "这话别在卫兵跟前学。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.73.02": "那得看是哪只鸡。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.73.03": "更糟的主意我也听过。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.73.04": "这话不是鸡说的吧？",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.74.01": "按它们的说法，是它们先来的。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.74.02": "你去跟鸡讲讲看哪儿能站。",
  "mcacapitals.dialogue.upbeat.response.evening.74.03": "到这份上，它们还不如干脆交税算了。"
}
